  "root": ".",
  "rules": "Rules: fetch and write only; no network or system changes; primary sources first, press second; quote verbatim with URL and UTC time; every row gets checked_utc; bounded none-found lines per task; do not use the author's posts; do not re-collect held facts; no motive asserted; name only public people in public roles; distinguish contribution from vote and independent expenditure from coordination; confirm homonyms; unattributed c4 donors stay unattributed; use server-side filtered and fully paginated FEC pulls; after three failed fetch attempts record the gap; header comment with fetch time and caps.",
